<figure id="S4.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F9.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 9</span>: </span><span id="S4.F9.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S4.F9.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct Predictions &amp; Correct Reasoning by Prompt.</span>
Each line shows model performance across prompts for vulnerability detection in the wild. Overall, <span id="S4.F9.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">P-Decomp</span> shows relatively consistent performance across all models.<span id="S4.F9.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">P-CoT</span> and <span id="S4.F9.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">P-P&amp;S</span> both shows overall better performance.
</span></figcaption><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F9.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="180.1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 342.38 180.1" width="342.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,180.1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(52.83,0) translate(0,60.09) matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -52.83 -60.09)"><g class="ltx_nestedsvg" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0) translate(63.59,0) translate(0,65.53)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#BFBFBF;--ltx-fill-color:#BFBFBF;--ltx-fg-color:#BFBFBF;" color="#BFBFBF" fill="#BFBFBF" stroke="#BFBFBF" stroke-width="0.2pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 -5.44 L 0 114.29 M 71.74 -5.44 L 71.74 114.29 M 143.47 -5.44 L 143.47 114.29 M 215.21 -5.44 L 215.21 114.29"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#BFBFBF;--ltx-fill-color:#BFBFBF;--ltx-fg-color:#BFBFBF;" color="#BFBFBF" fill="#BFBFBF" stroke="#BFBFBF" stroke-width="0.2pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M -10.76 0 L 225.97 0 M -10.76 45.35 L 225.97 45.35 M -10.76 90.71 L 225.97 90.71"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000"><g stroke-width="0.2pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 -5.44 L 0 0.46 M 71.74 -5.44 L 71.74 0.46 M 143.47 -5.44 L 143.47 0.46 M 215.21 -5.44 L 215.21 0.46 M 0 114.29 L 0 108.38 M 71.74 114.29 L 71.74 108.38 M 143.47 114.29 L 143.47 108.38 M 215.21 114.29 L 215.21 108.38"></path></g><g stroke-width="0.2pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M -10.76 0 L -4.86 0 M -10.76 45.35 L -4.86 45.35 M -10.76 90.71 L -4.86 90.71 M 225.97 0 L 220.06 0 M 225.97 45.35 L 220.06 45.35 M 225.97 90.71 L 220.06 90.71"></path></g><g stroke-width="0.4pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M -10.76 -5.44 L -10.76 114.29 L 225.97 114.29 L 225.97 -5.44 L -10.76 -5.44 Z"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.7071 0.7071 -0.7071 0.7